WEBVTT

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.230
T...

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:11.170
Talk about a lack of personality...

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.160
How old are you?

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.900
Nineteen.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.980
I currently attend the same university 
that you and Kuro-senpai attended.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.740
I met you once at the university hospital.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.210
At the hospital?

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.380
I guess I can't blame 
you for not remembering.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.470
It was more than four years ago.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.110
What you said earlier was a lie, wasn't it?

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.630
That you're Kuro-kun's girlfriend.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.760
I mean, you're not Kuro-kun's type.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.190
Since he was dumped so cruelly 
by someone who <i>was</i> his type,

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:51.260
I think it's quite possible for 
him to seek the complete opposite.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.690
Ow!

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:58.190
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:58.190
<i>I heard that Kuro-kun's cousin who 
was in the hospital passed away,</i>

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:02.270
<i>so maybe he talked to her in desperation 
and now he just can't get rid of her...</i>

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:10.540
Fine! Behold how happy we look 
as a couple in this photo!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.100
Kuro-kun clearly isn't happy in this picture...

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:16.590
He's not having fun.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.260
Senpai's just so shy!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.720
That lie won't work on someone who 
dated him for more than five years.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.560
So... How is Kuro-kun, anyway?

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.640
He's still going to the university.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.030
Since he's not getting married to you,

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.610
On/Off

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.610
Power
 On/Off

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.610
High

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.990
he doesn't need to rush 
to get a job anymore.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.450
He was always thinking about 
going to graduate school.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.160
Our plans for marriage 
included that prospect.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.030
And yet you didn't get married.

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:48.620
You did run away from Kuro-senpai, after all.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.450
What was I supposed to do?

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.500
The possibility of him not being 
human never crossed my mind.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.350
Sorry... I said too much.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.340
Well, you're not wrong.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.860
Kuro-senpai seems human, but likely 
can't be categorized as such.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.570
I'm in a similar situation myself.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.570
So we're the perfect match, don't you think?

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.710
Similar?

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:20.670
What are you, exactly?

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:23.900
Yokai, ayakashi, spectres, demons...

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.340
I am their Goddess of Wisdom.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:32.130
Just think of me as a priestess who mediates 
their conflicts and solves their problems.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:39.010
I don't think a priestess can be deflowered...

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.510
More importantly, our issue 
at hand is Steel Lady Nanase.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.220
Have the police already 
begun their investigation?

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.570
One of our detectives noticed something 
strange going on in the city,

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.150
so he's been looking into it.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.360
Any crime or damage reports?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.860
It's only a matter of time until we see them.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:31.250
That Steel Lady Nanase was far 
more violent than I'd heard about.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.830
If we leave her be, she 
might commit a murder soon.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.820
Indeed. I'm fearful of that, as well.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.230
We need to deal with her immediately.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:44.000
Whether it's a yokai or an urban legend,

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.390
has there ever been an incident 
significant enough to warrant police action?

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.720
I have a hard time believing 
something so uncertain, vague,

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.170
and unseen would actually cause an incident.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.150
But Steel Lady Nanase 
is completely different.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.400
That's a great observation.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.900
Proper monsters are rather modest and try 
not to draw attention to themselves.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.640
But there's nothing proper about her.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.370
That's why the perfectly 
respectable ghosts and monsters

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.820
that have resided here for quite some time

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:15.540
live in fear ever since she appeared 
and came to ask me for help,

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.470
even if it meant traveling 
hundreds of kilometers.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:22.500
By the way...

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.110
Why isn't Kuro-kun with you?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.510
Since the yokai fear him, 
he'd probably be useful right now.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:33.060
Besides, he's not the type 
of person to let his junior

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.450
go yokai hunting on their own.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:38.780
I'd planned to finish this quickly 
and head home the same day,

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.520
so I didn't see the need to invite him.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.730
But the way you are, you'd invite him 
like you were going on vacation.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:48.570
Yes, well... Kuro-senpai contracted 
a highly infectious disease...

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.700
Why did you look away when you said that?

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.660
May I have another cup of coffee?

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:53.890
Don't change the subject!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.050
Well, the truth is...

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:02.720
Kuro-senpai disappeared last week, and I 
haven't been able to get a hold of him.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.580
He hasn't even replied to 
the voicemails I left him.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:09.010
This was the last message 
I received from him.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.640
Kuro-senpai

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.640
(no subject)

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.640
Something came up. Don't look for me.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:14.100
No, really... Kuro-kun doesn't like you.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:18.100
Again, Kuro-senpai just isn't very 
good at expressing his feelings...

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.060
Remember when I said lies like 
that wouldn't work with me?

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:30.020
I'm the only one fit to be with Senpai! 
Why is he acting like this?!

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:36.290
When we were dating, he never 
ignored any of my calls or messages.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.300
Yes, he was always...

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:43.000
right by my side whenever I needed him to be.

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.740
You have some nerve bragging 
when all it took was

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.450
a poor little kappa to scare you away!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.340
Wha—

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:54.270
I'm only worried about Kuro-kun 
because you're obviously shady!

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.920
There's no reason for a woman 
who has no ties to him anymore

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:58.310
to be worried about him!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.680
That's right.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.010
This has nothing to do with me anymore.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.070
But the fact that he hasn't 
contacted you in a week

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.500
is definitely weird.

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:11.780
Right. Still, it's not like 
I don't have any leads...

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.050
Besides, he won't actually 
die even if you kill him.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:16.660
It's actually likely that

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.500
whoever tries to kill him will 
be in for a big disappointment.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.920
Unless something truly awful happens, 
he'll probably come back to life.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.630
<i>So she also knows about 
Kuro-kun's unique condition.</i>

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:32.470
<i>She stays with him, despite knowing that fact.
She's doing what I couldn't do.</i>

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:36.410
<i>I guess she really does like Kuro-kun.</i>

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.570
I'll do whatever I can to solve the 
matter regarding Steel Lady Nanase.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.430
But if you happen to run into her again,

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.900
make sure you run away this 
time without any hesitation.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:49.640
Can you even do anything about 
that monster in your state?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:52.650
Isn't your right eye fake?

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:54.660
Ah, so you noticed.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.550
One eye and one leg.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:00.910
This is why I'm close to the 
gods, as well as the ayakashi.

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.420
This is also the reason that 
I'll be perfectly fine.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:09.370
Well, then...

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:11.290
Thank you very much for the coffee.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:12.300
Oh.

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:15.740
If you'd like, I'll gladly send you 
a wedding invitation whenever

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.050
Kuro-senpai and I get married.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.430
That won't be necessary!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.690
I never imagined I'd run into Saki-san.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.290
That was so unexpected.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:30.280
But I doubt I'll ever see her again.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.270
What a lovely view. Shall we?

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:51.130
Now, then... I wonder where 
Steel Lady Nanase will appear next.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.300
<b>Nanase Karin</b>

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:58.980
<i>Nanase Karin.</i>

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:03.560
<i>The idol whose real name was Nanase 
Haruko wasn't particularly famous.</i>

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.990
<i>She did grow a bit more famous 
because of how she died,</i>

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:09.310
<i>but most people didn't 
know about her prior to it.</i>

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.740
<i>She debuted in June when she was seventeen.</i>

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.670
Those melons will be a hit!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.420
It's a crime for them to go unnoticed!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.770
S-Sir! You can't just blurt that out...

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:22.580
You're blind if you think my chest 
is all I've got going for me.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.550
She's so vivacious! I like her even more!

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:29.880
<i>She was personally scouted by the 
president of a talent agency.</i>

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.730
<i>She wasn't very popular in the beginning, 
but a year after her debut...</i>

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.510
I landed you a new job!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.550
It's a main role in a late-night drama!

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.050
What?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.770
<b>Late-night Serial Drama
Fiery Youth!\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
The Girl Who Breathes Fire!
Treatment</b>

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.830
Let's burn up!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.610
<b>Fiery Youth!</b>

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.610
<b>The Girl Who Breathes Fire!</b>

00:09:56.860 --> 00:10:01.050
<i>This is basically another kind 
of crime deterrent, warning</i>

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:07.120
<i>The tank on my back just shows 
what a pure, modest girl I am</i>

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:11.110
<i>I mean, I know I'm going to 
risk my life, it's a given</i>

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:16.300
<i>You've been waiting for me, right?</i>

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.860
<i>Sorry</i>

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.600
<i>I sorta pulled the trigger, te-he!</i>

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:27.270
<i>I want to take both the scalding 
pain and the burning pleasure</i>

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.900
<i>And share them with you!</i>

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.440
<i>Please, grant me my wish, oil magnate</i>

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.900
<i>I want to set your oil field ablaze</i>

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:40.110
<i>Burn it to a crisp, 
until there's nothing left!</i>

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.280
<i>Please tell me it's okay, oh great general</i>

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:50.370
<i>Love can be naked, let's burn it 
(burn it) all of it (all of it)</i>

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:55.770
<i>Let's burn up with my flamethrower</i>

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:03.690
<i>After that, Nanase Karin got more 
offers to be on TV and radio,</i>

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.940
<i>and she was praised for her 
quick wit and skilled speech.</i>

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.650
<i>She passed the entrance exam to a 
renowned national university in one try,</i>

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.210
<i>and that also made headlines.</i>

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:17.010
<i>If you just looked at her history, 
you could consider her life a success,</i>

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:20.110
<i>but she never amounted to more 
than an idol with a cult following.</i>

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.690
<i>But her good luck brought misfortune, too,</i>

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:24.450
<i>as some had a grudge against her.</i>

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:29.750
<i>So what was the sequence of events 
that led to Nanase Karin's death</i>

