What?

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:51.630
<i>In June of the year she turned nineteen, 
when her idol career was on the rise,</i>

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.230
<i>her father died.</i>

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.590
<i>It was ruled an unfortunate accident in which 
he fell down the steps to his apartment,</i>

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.330
<i>and nothing seemed suspicious at the time.</i>

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:06.460
I'll continue to do my best 
for my late father, too.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.620
<i>But near the end of November that same year,</i>

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.570
<i>suspicions suddenly arose about his death.</i>

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:17.650
<i>There were rumors that Nanase Karin 
resented her father because</i>

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.230
<i>he quit work when she got famous,</i>

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.840
<i>and that she killed him and 
made it look like an accident.</i>

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:26.150
<i>There was also a large 
life insurance policy on him.</i>

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:29.110
<i>Her father had</i>

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:32.600
<i>begun complaining to his 
friend a month before his death.</i>

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:37.570
She's making a fool of me.

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:40.730
She's always rubbed her 
intelligence in my face.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:44.490
<i>A note hinting at his suspicion that 
his daughter was trying to kill him</i>

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.120
I think Haruko is trying to kill me.
I'm sure that by the time someone
reads this, Haruko will have already killed me.
I just know it.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:48.120
<i>was found five months after his death.</i>

