Idol Dies by Steel Beam

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:00.980
Terada-san.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.180
Do you think it's completely unfathomable

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:06.590
that Steel Lady Nanase is actually a ghost?

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:08.070
That again?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.710
Looking at her history, I thought

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:13.230
it was highly probable for 
her to reappear as a ghost.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.610
Suspicions that she killed her 
father were never cleared up,

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:19.960
and of course, the ones who spread the 
rumors refused to take responsibility.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.920
I'm sure Nanase Karin was doing what 
she could to get her name out there,

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.610
so I can see how she'd come 
back as a vengeful spirit

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:29.970
just so she could attack society as a whole.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.300
I can believe that much.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.350
Right. I realize the existence 
of ghosts seems unbelievable.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.400
I don't deny the existence of ghosts.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:42.680
I believe in spirits enough that 
I visit my relatives' graves every year.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.360
But Steel Lady Nanase's different.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.400
She's... Yeah...

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.590
She seems artificial.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.570
People saying she's wearing a mini-skirt dress

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:56.950
or that she's missing part of her face 
or swinging around a steel beam...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.190
That all just sounds like stuff

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:05.030
the society that drove Nanase Karin to 
death would be ecstatic to hear about.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.510
There's something off about 
a girl dressed like that

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.220
if she came back as a vengeful 
spirit to get back at society.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.490
That means there must 
be something else hidden

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.990
in the shadows behind this, 
other than Nanase Karin's will.

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:20.030
<i>Oh, he's right.</i>

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.760
<i>If Steel Lady Nanase is supposed 
to be a vengeful spirit,</i>

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:27.060
<i>logically, she probably wouldn't 
be pandering to the masses.</i>

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.320
<i>Steel Lady Nanase is a real vengeful spirit,</i>

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:34.970
<i>but at this point, it's near impossible 
to convince Terada-san of that.</i>

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:36.660
But also,

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.100
we have to consider the possibility 
that Nanase Karin's accidental death

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.060
may have actually been a murder,

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.790
and that's what caused the 
Steel Lady Nanase incidents.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.170
Right, of course.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.420
Here are the investigation papers.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.930
If you'd look through them for me

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.980
and just explain the important 
parts to me later, that'd be great.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.050
Yes, sir.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.390
<b>Internet</b>

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.390
<b>30 minutes</b>

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.390
<b>100 yen</b>

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:59.390
<i>What to do...</i>

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.640
<i>Usually, I'd be able to talk to ghosts,</i>

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.810
<i>and even if they didn't have a face, 
I could still communicate with them.</i>

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.180
<i>It's obvious that those who are 
powerful enough to kill people</i>

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.900
<i>would have a certain amount of intelligence.</i>

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:14.700
<i>But that's not the case 
with Steel Lady Nanase.</i>

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.830
<i>She's supposed to be a ghost,</i>

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:19.010
<i>but I sensed no will or ability to think in her,</i>

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:21.120
<i>and she didn't respond to my voice.</i>

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.810
<i>A deep-seated grudge, 
vindictive feelings, evil thoughts...</i>

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:28.380
<i>Those should power her existence, 
but I don't sense them, either.</i>

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:31.890
<i>It's as though she's an empty puppet...</i>

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.170
<i>Her very existence is enough 
to terrify the monsters</i>

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:39.510
<i>in Makurazaka City out of ever going near her.</i>

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:43.440
I'd really like more useful information...

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.440
