00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.500
This illustration looks exactly like 
the Steel Lady Nanase I saw yesterday.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.020
With lots of eyewitness accounts

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.910
and knowing what the living 
Nanase Karin looked like,

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:56.250
I'm sure something similar could be drawn,

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:59.410
but is it really possible to 
draw something this accurate?

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.570
This illustration looks like

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.910
it was done by someone who saw 
Steel Lady Nanase personally.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:10.170
No... It's actually the exact opposite.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:14.050
If that's the case, it's going to 
be difficult to defeat her.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:16.780
First and foremost, I need more information.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.850
All the information online is a mess.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:26.600
I want accurate references regarding 
Nanase Karin's death from a reliable source.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.790
That would mean the police.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.990
I really don't want to 
ask Saki-san for a favor.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:39.990
<i>Nanase Karin's body was found 
on Saturday, January 30th.</i>

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:44.750
<i>The location was a future condominium 
construction site that was near her hotel.</i>

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.270
<i>The first person to find her</i>

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:50.750
<i>was an old man who lived between 
the hotel and the construction site.</i>

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.780
On the night before I discovered the body,

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.760
I thought I heard something 
like a steel beam falling.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:00.420
It was raining really hard that day,

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:03.430
so I thought that might've 
caused something to fall apart.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.730
I went to check the next morning.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:12.300
And as I figured, some steel 
beams had fallen over.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:24.180
<i>The steel beam that had killed her 
was about three to five meters long,</i>

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:26.960
<i>and the body's face and 
head were shattered.</i>

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.710
<i>Her face was unrecognizable, 
and her teeth couldn't help, either.</i>

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.210
<i>Everything from the neck up was smashed.</i>

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:38.220
<i>They found her cellphone, 
wallet, and university ID,</i>

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.220
<i>which led them to believe that 
the body belonged to Nanase Haruko.</i>

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.220
