<i>Her fingerprints from her hotel room 
and her personal belongings matched,</i>

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.980
<i>and it was concluded that 
the body was Nanase Karin's.</i>

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:53.480
<i>The estimated time of death was between 
midnight and 1:00 AM on the 30th.</i>

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:57.490
<i>That also matches the time 
the old man heard the noise.</i>

