00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:00.810
<i>The police continued their 
investigation with the possibilities</i>

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:04.040
<i>of suicide, murder, or an accident in mind,</i>

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.540
<i>but officially ruled it an accident.</i>

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.950
<i>Under normal circumstances,</i>

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.550
<i>they should've been able to come 
to a conclusion much faster...</i>

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.600
<i>Perhaps it's because this was 
the bizarre death of an idol,</i>

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:18.690
<i>but they're taking their time and putting 
a lot of work into this investigation.</i>

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.350
<i>Probably because the reputation 
of the police is on the line.</i>

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.150
<i>But there's one part that's bugging me.</i>

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.680
Nanase Hatsumi

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.680
<i>Nanase Karin's older sister</i>

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.130
<i>and the statement she made.</i>

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.190
<i>She...</i>

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:08.090
<i>Y-Yokai?</i>

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.440
I'm terribly sorry to disturb you so late at night!

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:22.200
I cannot blame you for being surprised!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:26.070
But I am Tree Spirit Gen'ichiro!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:30.790
I have come on orders from Our 
Lady of One Eye and One Leg!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.870
One eye and one leg?

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.010
<i>It must be her!</i>

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.110
<i>Yay!</i>

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:42.130
I beg of you, please do not be violent!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:45.050
I am nothing more than a frail tree spirit!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.220
Please stop.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.970
There's no reason for a monster to fear me.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.390
Also, please quiet down.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:55.150
But my lady told me that you 
had rather violent tendencies,

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.900
so I should be careful to mind my manners...

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.030
<i>I'm going to punch that brat 
the next time I see her...</i>

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.740
So what does she want with me?

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:07.570
This has to do with the 
matter of the Steel Lady.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:11.660
She wanted to humbly request your assistance.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.670
Mine?

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.370
If you cannot offer assistance,

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.750
then every night from now on,

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:22.400
the tree spirits Gen'jiro, 
Gen'zaburo, Gen'shiro,

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.760
and so on will come asking for your 
assistance, just as I have tonight.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.670
Exactly how many siblings do you have?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.900
This is basically bullying!

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:31.760
According to my lady,

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:37.520
she wants to know more about the 
death of the human, Nanase Karin,

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:42.530
so she can figure out how 
to defeat Steel Lady Nanase.

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.180
As for why she wanted to know, she'd like 
to meet with you and tell you herself.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:52.250
<i>She's also wondering about 
how Nanase Karin died?</i>

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:55.960
All right. Where do I need to go?

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.460
Thank you for waiting.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.780
Here's your seafood yakisoba.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.460
<i>I wonder if Saki-san will actually show up.</i>

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:07.620
<i>Even if she were to help me out,</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:11.140
<i>I wonder if she'll be able 
to bring me any files.</i>

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:15.340
<i>Not bad. Not bad at all.</i>

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:18.100
My lady.

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:21.360
Steel Lady Nanase has appeared.

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.640
Where did she appear?

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:25.110
The bus stop on 3-chome in Makurazaka.

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.340
<i>That's rather close.</i>

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:31.100
Once Saki-san arrives, tell her 
to either wait here for my return

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:35.560
or go to the location where 
Steel Lady Nanase appeared later.

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:36.730
Okay.

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:39.080
Saki-san just adores children,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.680
so she'll be thrilled if you let her dote on you.

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:45.750
I'm sure she wouldn't mind if you 
touched her butt or a boob or two.

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:47.130
Yippee!

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:49.630
I can't wait to see her reaction.

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:53.890
More importantly, we can't 
let any civilians get attacked.

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:57.140
It's impossible for me 
to cover the whole city,

00:22:57.140 --> 00:23:00.460
but since she appeared close by, 
I need to do something.

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:04.150
<i>I found her?</i>

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:07.070
<b>Maximum Height</b>

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>That's not good. She's attacking someone.</i>

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.560
Kuro-senpai?!

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:45.040
To Be Continued

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:47.020
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:49.650
Sakuragawa Kuro is having trouble with 
Steel Lady Nanase's fierce attacks.

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:51.900
Steel Lady Nanase is no normal spectre.

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:52.870
After Nanase Karin's death,

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:56.870
why did she manifest as a monster 
and gain incredible powers?

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.390
